 directors and a company secretary"},{"contents":[{"text":"You need at least one shareholder, who can be a director.","type":"paragraph"},{"contents":[{"href":"/limited-company-formation/shareholders","text":"Check how to choose shareholders for a company limited by shares"},{"href":"/tax-on-dividends","text":"Find out how dividends from shares are taxed"}],"type":"list"}],"title":"Decide who the shareholders are"},{"contents":[{"text":"You need at least one guarantor who can be a director.","type":"paragraph"},{"contents":[{"href":"/limited-company-formation/guarantors","text":"Check how to choose guarantors for a company limited by guarantee"}],"type":"list"}],"logic":"or","title":"Decide who your guarantors are"},{"contents":[{"text":"You need to identify people with significant control (PSC) - for example, anyone with more than 25% of the shares or voting rights.","type":"paragraph"},{"contents":[{"href":"/guidance/people-with-significant-control-pscs","text":"Find out what counts as a PSC"}],"type":"list"},{"text":"You'll confirm these when you register your company with Companies House.","type":"paragraph"}],"logic":"and","title":"Identify people with significant control (PSC) over your company"},{"contents":[{"text":"You need to prepare documents agreeing how to run your company. These documents include the :","type":"paragraph"},{"contents":[{"text":"'memorandum of association'"},{"text":"'articles of association'"},{"text":"'statement of capital'"},{"text":"'statement of guarantee' "}],"style":"choice","type":"list"},{"contents":[{"href":"/limited-company-formation/documents","text":"Find out how to create these documents"}],"type":"list"}],"title":"Prepare documents agreeing how to run your company"},{"contents":[{"contents":[{"href":"/running-a-limited-company/company-and-accounting-records","text":"Check the company and accounting records you must keep"}],"type":"list"}],"title":"Check what records you'll need to keep"},{"contents":[{"contents":[{"href":